{
    "title": "SilverSingles: Mature Dating",
    "description": "Rediscover the allure of dating and meeting like-minded 50+ singles on our new and improved SilverSingles app for Android.\r\nDownload it for free today and see why so many singles trust us to find the love they\u2019re looking for.\r\n\r\nThe SilverSingles Difference:\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Customized personality test for tailored matches\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Unique profile and preferences customization tools\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Highly-compatible matches delivered daily\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Exclusive \"Have you met\" feature suggests additional wildcard matches daily\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Favorites and Mutual Favorites Lists to track singles of interest\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Complete profile access to your matches\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Start new connections with smiles and likes\r\n\r\nSilverSingles Premium Member* Advantages:\r\n\r\n\u25b8 See your matches\u2019 photos\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Send and receive unlimited messages\r\n\r\n\u25b8 See who\u2019s visited your profile\r\n\r\n*Supports 1, 3, 6, or 12-month auto-renewable subscriptions.\r\n\r\nWho uses SilverSingles?\r\n\r\nSilverSingles is crafted exclusively for 50+ singles.\r\nWhether you\u2019re looking for a meaningful friendship, the love of your life, or something in-between, customize your preferences and let SilverSingles work its magic to find that special someone.\r\n\r\nWhy try SilverSingles?\r\n\r\nWe\u2019re passionate about providing the most personalized online dating experience, introducing you to 50+ singles who live nearby and suit your preferences perfectly.\r\n\r\nAbout SilverSingles\r\n\r\nSince 2017, SilverSingles has been the go-to app for 50+ singles seeking meaningful connections with like-minded individuals in similar life stages.\r\nWe pride ourselves on making life-changing matches and can\u2019t wait to do the same for you.\r\n\r\nHow to Get Started\r\n\r\nDownload the app, complete the personality test, and customize your profile.\r\nReceive highly-compatible matches daily and use our unique features to explore and connect with other singles.\r\nDon\u2019t miss out on meeting like-minded individuals seeking meaningful connections.\r\nDownload the app today and take the first step toward the future you desire, filled with the love you deserve.\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT INFORMATION FOR SUBSCRIPTIONS\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Upgrading to Premium is a subscription that automatically renews for the same price and duration as the initial package.Please see details, including how to cancel, below.\r\n\r\n\u25b8 For example: a three-month subscription renews into another three-month subscription at the same price as the initial package.\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Your Play Store account will be charged at purchase confirmation.\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Auto-renewal may be turned off in Account Settings and must be turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\r\n\u25b8 No cancellation of the current plan is allowed during the subscription period.\r\n\r\n\u25b8 When a subscription is canceled, access to Premium features expires at the end of the current payment period.\r\n\r\n\u25b8 Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, is forfeited when purchasing a Premium subscription.\r\n\r\nWith SilverSingles, you are one step closer to meeting the right person.\r\nDownload now and begin your journey to finding love and companionship.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Rediscover the allure of dating and meeting like-minded 50+ singles on our new and improved SilverSingles app for Android.<br>Download it for free today and see why so many singles trust us to find the love they\u2019re looking for.<br><br>The SilverSingles Difference:<br><br>\u25b8 Customized personality test for tailored matches<br><br>\u25b8 Unique profile and preferences customization tools<br><br>\u25b8 Highly-compatible matches delivered daily<br><br>\u25b8 Exclusive &quot;Have you met&quot; feature suggests additional wildcard matches daily<br><br>\u25b8 Favorites and Mutual Favorites Lists to track singles of interest<br><br>\u25b8 Complete profile access to your matches<br><br>\u25b8 Start new connections with smiles and likes<br><br>SilverSingles Premium Member* Advantages:<br><br>\u25b8 See your matches\u2019 photos<br><br>\u25b8 Send and receive unlimited messages<br><br>\u25b8 See who\u2019s visited your profile<br><br>*Supports 1, 3, 6, or 12-month auto-renewable subscriptions.<br><br>Who uses SilverSingles?<br><br>SilverSingles is crafted exclusively for 50+ singles.<br>Whether you\u2019re looking for a meaningful friendship, the love of your life, or something in-between, customize your preferences and let SilverSingles work its magic to find that special someone.<br><br>Why try SilverSingles?<br><br>We\u2019re passionate about providing the most personalized online dating experience, introducing you to 50+ singles who live nearby and suit your preferences perfectly.<br><br>About SilverSingles<br><br>Since 2017, SilverSingles has been the go-to app for 50+ singles seeking meaningful connections with like-minded individuals in similar life stages.<br>We pride ourselves on making life-changing matches and can\u2019t wait to do the same for you.<br><br>How to Get Started<br><br>Download the app, complete the personality test, and customize your profile.<br>Receive highly-compatible matches daily and use our unique features to exp